abstract: "A reproducible workflow for checking comparison premises, screening supplied cost intervals, computing conditional Pareto sets, and reporting exact transition boundaries under a declared widening model. Published numerical summaries and generic synthesis examples do not establish radiation protection. Reused data and HDL retain the licenses and attribution documented alongside them."
